flowchart TD
  accTitle: Staged worker-uplift observability activation flow
  accDescr {
    The diagram shows the staged worker-uplift observability contract, the eight private
    metrics endpoints, truthful health and ownership gates, Grafana Cloud metrics and logs,
    quota safeguards, deferred signals, and the evidence required before the work is live.
  }
  A["Staged contract: human review pending"] --> B["Reconcile and merge observability backend and infra changes"]
  A --> V0["Contracts and Runtime 1.0 released\nin required order"]
  V0 --> V1["Eight service sources merged; immutable\nimages published and verified"]
  V1 --> Live["Live 2026-08-01 19:04 UTC: worker_uplift cutover_active;\nwrites on, legacy dispatch and scheduling off;\nolder candidate 71b030 under rollback deadline"]
  Live --> Freeze["Temporary freeze: worker merges and runtime mutations;\nno fetcher v2 migration while cutover_active"]
  Freeze --> V2["PR 471 pins Runtime 1 but remains undeployed;\nreconcile, qualify, deploy, and verify fresh scrapes"]
  B --> B1["Verify final leases, lifecycle, health, identity,\nbuckets, labels, security, and workflow checks"]
  B1 --> C["Deploy eight worker images and apply reviewed GitOps changes"]
  C --> D["Backend Alloy scrapes 127.0.0.1:18081-18088"]
  D --> E["Truthful liveness, startup, and readiness"]
  D --> F["Grafana Cloud Metrics"]
  D --> G["Grafana Cloud Logs"]
  D --> U["Alloy readiness, backlog, errors, drops, and freshness"]
  E --> H{"Reconciled production ownership?"}
  H -->|"Non-owning service"| I["expected_active 0"]
  I --> I1["Still require deployed, up 1, scrape under 180s,\nexact identity and readiness series"]
  H -->|"Production owner"| J["expected_active 1"]
  J --> J1["Require readiness ok, loop or stage activity,\nlast success and worker-local paging"]
  F --> K["Seven delivery-stage seconds histograms,\nscheduler cycle and freshness"]
  F --> L["RabbitMQ depth, unacked, and consumers"]
  F --> L1["Backend outbox age only when available 1;\ndistinct from global feed freshness"]
  F --> M["70/85/95 quota alerts; cadence unresolved:\nabout 72k at six minutes, 86.4k standing major,\nor reviewed threshold change"]
  F --> W["Exactly four native 30-day SLOs"]
  W --> X["Worker 99% across all delivery stages;\nsource alert default false, live value unconfirmed"]
  W --> Y["Global feed freshness: burn and 3-hour critical alerts always enabled"]
  G --> N["Six Loki labels; pipelineRunId, correlationId,\nand traceparent stay structured metadata"]
  N --> N1["Query-time dashboard drilldown;\ndatasource derived links deferred, no Tempo"]
  A --> O["Sentry remains canonical for scrubbed exceptions"]
  A --> P["Tempo, exemplars, and profiles remain deferred"]
  A --> Q["Article/model bodies and secrets forbidden; identifiers never labels"]
  A --> T["Backend owns deploy, Alloy and outbox; service repos own signals;\ninfra owns Grafana; meta repo coordinates"]
  I --> R["Retain query, alert, privacy, and failure-drill evidence"]
  I1 --> R
  J --> R
  J1 --> R
  K --> R
  L --> R
  L1 --> R
  M --> R
  N --> R
  N1 --> R
  V2 --> R
  U --> R
  X --> R
  Y --> R
  Q --> R
  R --> S["Only then describe observability as live"]
